      "id": "3466a751-ee70-476a-9af2-71b380990bb0",
      "name": "Convert to File"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const d = $json;\n\nconst money = (n) =>\n  Number(n || 0).toLocaleString('en-US', { minimumFractionDigits: 2 });\n\nconst cur = d.currency || 'SAR';\nconst vendor = d.vendor_name || 'unknown supplier';\nconst trace = (d.trace || []).join(' -> ') || 'policy rules only';\n\nconst body = `To: accounts-payable@company.com\nSubject: [REVIEW] Invoice held — ${vendor} — ${money(d.total_amount)} ${cur}\n\nAn invoice has been held for review rather than paid.\n\n  Supplier        ${vendor}\n  Invoice number  ${d.invoice_number || '—'}\n  Date            ${d.issue_date || '—'}\n  Amount          ${money(d.total_amount)} ${cur}\n  Document        ${d.image}\n\nWHY IT WAS HELD\n\n${d.reason}\n\nHOW IT WAS DECIDED\n\n  Decided by      ${d.source}\n  Checks run      ${trace}\n\nThis invoice has NOT been paid. Please review the document and either\napprove it for payment or raise it with the supplier.\n\n--\nDrafted automatically. Nothing has been sent to the supplier.\n`;\n\nreturn { json: { email: body, filename: `${d.image}.eml` } };"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ],
      "id": "0a434d94-d78f-4286-bd20-53b2d8c109f4",
      "name": "Draft review email"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const d = $json;\n\nconst body = `To: document-intake@company.com\nSubject: [RESCAN] Unreadable document — ${d.image}\n\nThis document could not be read reliably, so nothing was recorded from it\nand no payment has been scheduled.\n\n  Document        ${d.image}\n  Supplier        ${d.vendor_name || 'could not be read'}\n  Invoice number  ${d.invoice_number || 'could not be read'}\n\nWHAT WENT WRONG\n\n${d.reason}\n\nWHAT WE NEED\n\nA clearer copy of the same document: the whole page, straight on, evenly\nlit, no glare across the printed figures. A photo is fine if it is sharp.\n\nTwo different models were already tried on this image, so the problem is\nthe copy rather than the reading -- a better scan should go through\nwithout anyone having to type the figures in by hand.\n\n--\nDrafted automatically. Nothing has been sent to the supplier.\n`;\n\nreturn { json: { email: body, filename: `${d.image}.eml` } };"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        160
      ],
